    "summary": "Midas has partnered with Wellington Management to launch mWIN, a tokenised multi-sector credit strategy issued through a Luxembourg securitisation vehicle.\nThe post Midas and Wellington Bring Actively Managed Credit Strategy Onchain appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://thefintechtimes.com/midas-and-wellington-bring-actively-managed-credit-strategy-onchain/",
